{
  "title": "Warm Silky Malaysian Eggs Frittata",
  "description": "A resinous and silky Malaysian dish featuring eggs, cooked to perfection in a bain-marie, perfect for a high-protein breakfast or brunch",
  "cuisine": "Malaysian",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
